- His name is Odin. He's a big sweetheart.

00:00:31.890 --> 00:00:33.180
He's a Rottweiler.

00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:35.190
Yeah, he's three years old.

00:00:35.190 --> 00:00:37.050
And, yeah he's the love of my life.

00:00:37.050 --> 00:00:37.883
Love that dude.

00:00:37.883 --> 00:00:39.134
- Look at those snuggles happening

00:00:39.134 --> 00:00:39.967
right now.
- I know.

00:00:39.967 --> 00:00:41.280
He's the greatest. I miss him.

00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:42.360
He lives with my parents.

00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:44.700
I got my own apartment,
whatever, you know?

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:46.170
I'm 23 now.
(audience cheering)

00:00:46.170 --> 00:00:47.670
- So really your parents got a dog?

00:00:47.670 --> 00:00:49.050
- Yeah, they have a dog now.

00:00:49.050 --> 00:00:50.670
Which is like, it's a rough situation.

00:00:50.670 --> 00:00:53.550
I feel like a lot of, I swore
I would never be that kid.

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:55.470
I was like, I'm responsible.

00:00:55.470 --> 00:00:57.090
