00:01:09.240 --> 00:01:10.680
I was going to all the appointments.

00:01:10.680 --> 00:01:11.580
I was doing everything.

00:01:11.580 --> 00:01:12.510
- Yeah.
- I was making sure.

00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:14.340
But with Odin, I slacked off.

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:15.900
In my older age, I've gotten weak.

00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:16.950
- That's 'cause you're young twenties

00:01:16.950 --> 00:01:17.783
and you're just having fun.

00:01:17.783 --> 00:01:18.795
- Exactly. I'm wildin'.

00:01:18.795 --> 00:01:19.628
- Yeah, that's kinda what
you're supposed to do.

00:01:19.628 --> 00:01:20.648
- Yeah, yeah.

00:01:20.648 --> 00:01:22.170
