I had In N Out yesterday on
the way back to an event.

00:01:37.170 --> 00:01:38.280
- So it did not last long.

00:01:38.280 --> 00:01:40.170
- It did not last long at all.

00:01:40.170 --> 00:01:41.310
- In N Out is worth it.

00:01:41.310 --> 00:01:42.600
- It's worth it.
- It is.

