- I hope this shows up
- I'm from LA.

00:01:51.030 --> 00:01:52.920
- at your door later today.

00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:54.423
Like people see this.
- Yeah, exactly.

00:01:54.423 --> 00:01:55.864
- Like we know what he likes.

00:01:55.864 --> 00:01:57.557
- You know guys, wink wink.

00:01:57.557 --> 00:01:58.390
Nobody send it to me.

00:01:58.390 --> 00:01:59.848
- And I like diamonds.

00:01:59.848 --> 00:02:02.190
(audience laughing)

00:02:02.190 --> 00:02:03.270
- They're nice.

00:02:03.270 --> 00:02:04.650
Well, congratulations.

00:02:04.650 --> 00:02:05.483
