00:02:09.480 --> 00:02:12.330
'Cause you've been a
part of this whole thing

00:02:12.330 --> 00:02:14.070
for so long, like a decade, right?

00:02:14.070 --> 00:02:15.360
- Yeah. It's been, yeah.

00:02:15.360 --> 00:02:16.620
I feel, I always joke with people

00:02:16.620 --> 00:02:17.940
I'm like, when you've seen as much

00:02:17.940 --> 00:02:21.360
as I've seen the ripe age of 23.

00:02:21.360 --> 00:02:22.710
No, but I've been, yeah we've been

00:02:22.710 --> 00:02:25.260
doing it since I was 13 years old.

00:02:25.260 --> 00:02:27.450
Junior is a fantastic character.

00:02:27.450 --> 00:02:29.460
Wouldn't want to be on this
journey with anyone else.

00:02:29.460 --> 00:02:30.431
And I'm -

00:02:30.431 --> 00:02:31.264
- It's so rare, though, that you get

00:02:31.264 --> 00:02:33.300
