front of their eyes.

00:02:46.170 --> 00:02:48.690
And I think that's part of
the success of the show, so.

00:02:48.690 --> 00:02:50.040
- Absolutely. I agree.

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:53.490
Well we were talking about
your dog earlier, or dogs.

00:02:53.490 --> 00:02:54.810
Is it, and I'm sorry about Zeus.

00:02:54.810 --> 00:02:55.800
That sucks losing a pet.

00:02:55.800 --> 00:02:56.633
